  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **THOUSAND SONS** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), as [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, models of yours with this ability can make Ritual attempts. For each attempt, pick one of those models that has made no Ritual attempt yet this turn, and a Ritual your army has not yet tried this turn. That model then takes a Psychic test:\n\n1. **Roll 2D6** to begin the test.\n2. **Channel the Warp** (optional): you can roll a third D6.\n3. If the test rolled any doubles or triples, the model's unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).\n4. Should the model survive, its Psychic test result is the total of every die rolled in the test. If that result is at least the Ritual's Warp Charge, the model manifests the Ritual, whose effects you then resolve.\n\nThe Rituals are:\n\n- **Destiny’s Ruin** (Warp Charge 5, Psychic): pick an enemy unit up to 24\" from the manifesting model and **visible** to it. Whenever one of your **THOUSAND SONS** or **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** models attacks that unit, the attack can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the phase. With a Psychic test result of 10+, it can instead re-roll any Hit roll.\n- **Temporal Surge** (Warp Charge 6, Psychic): pick one of your **THOUSAND SONS** or **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** units up to 24\" from the manifesting model and **visible** to it, that is not in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of an enemy unit. It can then move up to D6\" with a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), or up to 6\" with a Psychic test result of 10+. Either way, it cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn.\n- **Doombolt** (Warp Charge 7, Psychic): pick an enemy unit up to 24\" from the manifesting model and **visible** to it; a [Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative) unit outside an [Attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units) must also be up to 12\" from that model. The unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds), or D3+3 with a Psychic test result of 11+.\n- **Twist of Fate** (Warp Charge 9, Psychic): pick an enemy unit up to 24\" from the manifesting model and **visible** to it. Whenever one of your **THOUSAND SONS** or **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** models attacks that unit, the attack gets +1 AP for the rest of the phase, or +2 AP with a Psychic test result of 12+.",
